e moral corruption that makes men turn into savages. In their attempt in ferrying Devender's family to safety , Pal , Tilak and Yogesh must face their own demons first.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":5.8}],"value":5.8,"age":"N/A"},"episode_id":12559,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}